NavReceiverAdminTest
├── given the constructor
│   ├── when the vault or the forwarder is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when the arguments are valid
│       └── it should store them
├── given setForwarder
│   ├── when the caller is not the owner
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when the forwarder is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when the forwarder is valid
│       └── it should swap the accepted caller
├── given setWorkflowIdentity
│   ├── when the caller is not the owner
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when the caller is the owner
│       └── it should store the identity
└── given supportsInterface
    ├── when the id is IReceiver or IERC165
    │   └── it should return true
    └── when the id is anything else
        └── it should return false
